Data availability

            We used version 4.6.1 of the WRF-ARW regional climate model (freely available at https://www2.mmm.ucar.edu/wrf/users/download/get_source.html) to generate all results. The land-cover data were obtained from the MODIS LULC dataset (MCD12Q1; https://www.earthdata.nasa.gov/data/catalog/lpcloud-mcd12q1-061), the FVC data were obtained from the GLASS dataset (https://glass.hku.hk/archive/FVC/MODIS/500M) and the meteorological forcing data were taken from the 0.25° FNL dataset (https://gdex.ucar.edu/datasets/d083003/). The simulation configurations and parameter settings are described in the article and its Supplementary Information. The delineation data for the urban study areas used in this study are available via Zenodo at https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.20919188 (ref. 64). Additional simulation output files and related information are available from the corresponding author upon reasonable request.
          Code availability

            The code used to decompose near-surface air temperature changes is available via Zenodo at https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.20919188 (ref. 64).
